      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Light industry female workers suffering from bronchial asthma demonstrated significant pulmonary ventilation disorders of mixed type with prevalent bronchial obstruction. Those changes prove long-standing harm caused by occupational factors. Inhalation provocative tests point out leading role of industrial dust in increased bronchial reactivity."},
